      "extract": "arXiv:hep-ph/9308276v1 14 Aug 1993 The Electroweak Chiral Lagrangian for the Standard Model with a heavy Higgs Maria J. Herrero∗and Ester Ruiz Morales† Departamento de F´ısica Te´orica Universidad Aut´onoma de Madrid Cantoblanco 28049 – Madrid Spain Abstract The most general chiral Lagrangian for electroweak interactions with the complete set of SU(2)L × U(1)Y invariant operators up to dimen- sion four is",
