      "extract": "We would like to add in this section some remarks and comments on the results for the EChL parameters presented in eq.([\\[aMH\\]](#aMH){reference-type=\"ref\" reference=\"aMH\"}). These finite values represent the non-decopling effects of a heavy Higgs particle in the SM to one-loop order. They contain valuable information since they serve as reference values to be compared with the corresponding predictions from other",
